As a part of -- you know , part of what we want to do to grow our company is to have more searches .
And what that means is we want to have more people who are healthy and educated .
More animals , if they start doing searches as well .
But partly , we want to make the world a better place , and so one thing that we &apos;re embarking upon is the Google Foundation , and we &apos;re in the process of setting that up .
