And that has -- you run into situations where you have this great acceptance of what you &apos;re doing , I characterized this emerging technology in an aphorism , which really talks about what I &apos;ve experienced , and I &apos;m sure what other people may have experienced in emerging technologies .
There &apos;s an interesting poll that came out recently under NAS -- I think it &apos;s MSNBC -- in which they asked the question , &quot; Are you in the market for a volantor ? &quot;
Twenty-three percent said , &quot; Yes , as soon as possible . &quot;
