You directly observe a few simple things .
It &apos;s worked really well . I get satisfaction out of seeing stuff that makes real change in the real world . We need a lot more of that , and a lot less abstract stuff .
When we were talking on the phone , one of the things you said that really astonished me was you said one thing you were passionate about was server farms . Tell me about that .
