I was , O.K. ; that &apos;s fine .
I finally went down there , and it was this old rusted circular thing , and two beds , and very kind of creepy and weird .
And I thought , you know , what were they thinking ?
You &apos;d think maybe cement , possibly , or something .
But anyway , I used this for a cover for the Nine Inch Nails DVD , and I &apos;ve also now fixed the bomb shelter with duct tape , and it &apos;s ready . I think I &apos;m ready . So .
