I find my experience from 20 years of Africa is that the seemingly impossible is possible .
Africa has not done bad .
In 50 years they &apos;ve gone from a pre-Medieval situation to a very decent 100-year-ago Europe , with a functioning nation and state .
I would say that sub-Saharan Africa has done best in the world during the last 50 years .
Because we don &apos;t consider where they came from .
